# =====================
# E2E (Robot Framework)
# `env/` above (virtualenv rule) also swallows e2e/env/ - re-include it so
# e2e.env.example (which run.ps1 needs) is committed; the real e2e.env stays ignored.
!/e2e/env/
/venv/
/e2e/results/
/e2e/env/e2e.env
BackEnd/.env.e2e-backup
# safety net if `robot` is ever run from the repo root without --outputdir
/log.html
/report.html
/output.xml
/playwright-log.txt
